{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_71","type":"agent_message","text":"The mismatch was test interference, not translation behavior: Cargo ran the three low-level tests concurrently, and all were mutating the same exported globals in each loaded DSO. I’m serializing in-process global-array access, making mismatch reports concise, and suppressing child harness noise; `main` cases remain parallel because each runs in its own process."}}
